<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Akun Marketing Anda AKTIF</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eef3f7;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Selamat! Akun Marketing <%= brandName %> Anda sudah aktif. Login sekarang.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#eef3f7;padding:24px 12px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(22,163,74,.14);">
<tr><td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a34a 0%,#0e7a5f 55%,#0b5fa5 100%);padding:28px 32px;text-align:center;">
<% if (logoUrl) { %><img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="<%= brandName %>" style="max-height:56px;max-width:220px;margin-bottom:10px;" /><br /><% } %>
<div style="font-size:40px;line-height:1;">🎉</div>
<div style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-top:6px;">Akun Marketing Anda AKTIF!</div>
<div style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;">Selamat bergabung di <%= brandName %> &times; V-Green</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;color:#0f2a43;">Halo <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">Kabar baik — pendaftaran Anda telah <strong>disetujui admin</strong>. Akun Marketing Anda sudah aktif dan siap digunakan.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:12px;"><tr><td style="padding:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#14532d;">
<strong>🔑 Kode referral Anda: <%= myRefCode %></strong><br />
Link ajukan lahan: <a href="<%= ajukanLink %>" style="color:#15803d;word-break:break-all;"><%= ajukanLink %></a><br />
Link rekrut marketing: <a href="<%= rekrutLink %>" style="color:#15803d;word-break:break-all;"><%= rekrutLink %></a>
</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:8px auto 20px;"><tr><td align="center" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5fa5,#16a34a);border-radius:999px;">
<a href="<%= loginUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 40px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;">🚀 Login ke Dashboard</a>
</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">📌 <strong>3 langkah pertama:</strong></p>
<ol style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d5469;">
<li>Login dengan email &amp; password yang Anda daftarkan.</li>
<li>Lengkapi profil (foto diri &amp; KTP) dan unduh <strong>ID Card</strong> digital Anda.</li>
<li>Bagikan link referral — setiap pengajuan lahan via link Anda tercatat atas nama Anda.</li>
</ol>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">Atasan/referral Anda: <strong><%= refOwner %></strong> (<%= refCode %>). Berkoordinasilah dengannya untuk wilayah prioritas sebelum mencari lahan.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e6edf3;text-align:center;">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#8aa0b4;"><strong><%= brandFull %></strong><br />Email otomatis dari info@knab.co.id — mohon tidak membalas langsung.<br />Butuh bantuan? Hubungi admin melalui kontak resmi kami di <a href="<%= appUrl %>" style="color:#0b5fa5;"><%= appUrl %></a>.</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
